WEBVTT

00:09.150 --> 00:11.120
So this is the material shop, huh?

00:11.990 --> 00:15.010
Thank you so much
for coming with me today!

00:15.010 --> 00:17.580
Well, shopping is part
of our club activities.

00:18.140 --> 00:21.020
Since I'm not sure what to do
for my next costume,

00:21.020 --> 00:25.300
I thought I'd get some inspiration today
from looking at fabrics and materials.

00:25.300 --> 00:27.550
I didn't know you had such a way.

00:28.140 --> 00:29.600
Alright, let's go.

00:39.060 --> 00:43.690
2.5 DIMENSIONAL SEDUCTION

02:05.980 --> 02:10.990
#13 CAN I MAKE A FRIEND?

02:12.800 --> 02:15.390
It's my first time at a material store.

02:15.390 --> 02:18.320
Oh, they have an actual cosplay corner!

02:18.320 --> 02:21.540
Of course.
Most of their customers are cosplayers.

02:21.540 --> 02:24.690
MADE FROM BOARD FOR COSPLAY
Wow! This is handmade?!

02:24.690 --> 02:25.990
MADE FROM BOARD FOR COSPLAY
Large weapons are essential

02:25.990 --> 02:28.630
MADE FROM BOARD FOR COSPLAY
for battleship girls after all.

02:28.990 --> 02:32.470
Anyway, I'm going to restock
basic materials for Liliel,

02:32.830 --> 02:35.360
so Senior, please rest
on a bench or something.

02:35.360 --> 02:37.430
I'll carry the stuff, so just call me.

02:37.860 --> 02:39.810
This one and this one...

02:39.930 --> 02:41.020
- Alright.
- What?!

02:42.660 --> 02:45.870
These cloths are pretty heavy, right?

02:50.650 --> 02:52.990
That happens too, I guess.

02:55.340 --> 02:56.530
Are you alright?

02:57.600 --> 02:59.730
If you want, I'll carry it.

03:02.080 --> 03:03.860
I'm sorry!

03:04.640 --> 03:05.080
Eh?

03:09.360 --> 03:13.010
Was it rude to touch
the cloth without permission?

03:13.010 --> 03:14.050
I should be careful.

03:21.130 --> 03:24.520
Off-white two-way and pink enamel...

03:35.700 --> 03:37.070
Liliel...

03:38.260 --> 03:38.820
Eh?

03:39.630 --> 03:41.850
U-Umm... You...

03:43.100 --> 03:45.250
Is this what they call cloth tell?

03:46.610 --> 03:47.580
5th place...

03:47.950 --> 03:48.790
What?

03:50.720 --> 03:52.170
Could it be...

03:52.170 --> 03:53.130
Nono—

03:53.130 --> 03:53.710
RUMBLE RUMBLE

03:53.710 --> 03:54.880
RUMBLE RUMBLE
Bloodlust?!

03:56.580 --> 03:57.430
I'll get stabbed!

04:01.510 --> 04:02.100
Eh?

04:02.100 --> 04:04.110
CINDERELLA STAR

04:04.110 --> 04:07.050
1ST ANNIVERSARY FESTIVAL
Cinderella Star cosplay event...

04:07.050 --> 04:07.690
MAY 28/29 HIRASAKI HALL INDUSTRY PLAZA B HALL

04:10.780 --> 04:13.110
Are you going to participate?

04:17.700 --> 04:18.820
Me too?

04:20.510 --> 04:22.700
I-I understand...

04:24.880 --> 04:25.290
Ah.

04:28.460 --> 04:29.520
Lilysa?

04:30.030 --> 04:31.620
What happened?

04:32.530 --> 04:34.060
About that...

04:35.150 --> 04:38.180
The 4th place? Nonoa? That girl?!

04:38.180 --> 04:39.510
I think so.

04:39.630 --> 04:40.500
CINDERELLA STAR

04:40.500 --> 04:42.640
CINDERELLA STAR
So, she'll be at this event?

04:42.640 --> 04:44.970
1ST ANNIVERSARY FESTIVAL
This has to be an invitation, right?

04:45.390 --> 04:47.450
But the way she looked at me...

04:47.450 --> 04:49.560
She also mentioned rankings, right?

04:51.690 --> 04:52.560
Don't tell me...

04:53.170 --> 04:54.650
A letter of challenge?!

04:55.020 --> 04:59.220
Does that mean she wants
to compete with you in this event?

04:59.220 --> 05:02.130
D-Does that mean she hates me?

05:02.130 --> 05:05.540
Calm down.
That's not necessarily the case.

05:06.010 --> 05:08.870
I can understand if the 5th place
wants to fight the 4th place.

05:09.390 --> 05:11.270
But her ranking was higher than yours, right?

05:11.270 --> 05:14.590
Maybe she wants to crush me
before she gets overtaken?

05:14.590 --> 05:18.490
Well, it depends on how you interpret it.

05:18.490 --> 05:20.230
Are you going, Lilysa?

05:21.890 --> 05:23.050
I...

05:23.970 --> 05:27.310
I want to believe
that all cosplayers are friends.

05:27.310 --> 05:29.540
T-That's why I'll go.

05:29.540 --> 05:32.270
I'm sure that Nonoa is not a bad person.

05:32.800 --> 05:35.500
You're right. I understand.

05:36.110 --> 05:40.850
But you can't go as Liliel
to a Cinderella Star-only event, can you?

05:41.430 --> 05:43.700
Senior, have you forgotten?

05:43.700 --> 05:44.240
What?

05:44.240 --> 05:45.110
1ST ANNIVERSARY DERESUTA

05:45.110 --> 05:47.830
1ST ANNIVERSARY DERESUTA
Why do you have Cinderella Star installed

05:47.830 --> 05:49.690
1ST ANNIVERSARY DERESUTA
on your phone despite you never playing it?

05:49.690 --> 05:50.450
1ST ANNIVERSARY DERESUTA
What?!

05:50.450 --> 05:52.300
Huh? Could it be?!

05:53.910 --> 05:56.000
The next costume has been decided.

05:56.430 --> 05:57.940
B-But...

05:57.940 --> 06:00.090
Can you make it in time?
The event is next week!

06:01.690 --> 06:04.250
Who do you think I am?

06:04.620 --> 06:07.390
What? Who?!

06:09.290 --> 06:12.160
L-Liliel... Incarnate?

06:12.160 --> 06:14.400
You didn't think that far, did you?

06:14.790 --> 06:18.030
Anyway, I'll make it in time,
so just leave it to me!

06:18.030 --> 06:19.670
O-Okay...

06:43.120 --> 06:46.970
Yeah, it's okay.
It's not weird.

06:46.970 --> 06:49.560
I'll cosplay as Coulia again for the event.

06:52.180 --> 06:53.560
Liliel...

06:53.890 --> 06:56.020
If only...

06:56.640 --> 06:57.270
If only she would be my friend...

06:57.270 --> 06:59.940
I CAN'T LOOK AT HER SINCE SHE'S TOO CUTE
If only she would be my friend...

06:59.940 --> 07:01.830
FRIEND MAKING NOTE
THIS YEAR'S GOAL: MAKE 1 FRIEND

07:04.050 --> 07:05.530
Today's reflection...

07:06.340 --> 07:11.490
A nice guy gave me a hand, but I ended up
glaring at him when I should've thanked him.

07:12.990 --> 07:15.090
Why am I like this?!

07:15.090 --> 07:18.960
I'm an introvert with
communication disorder...

07:19.910 --> 07:22.710
I started cosplaying because
I wanted to make friends.

07:22.710 --> 07:25.760
But I got so nervous at the event
and didn't say a word to anyone.

07:25.760 --> 07:29.100
I didn't even get to mingle
with other cosplayers!

07:29.100 --> 07:31.170
4TH PLACE, THE ICY BEAUTY COSPLAYER, NONOA
I'm not good at smiling,

07:31.170 --> 07:34.150
4TH PLACE, THE ICY BEAUTY COSPLAYER, NONOA
and I ended up becoming that kind of character!

07:36.140 --> 07:38.350
But today was a huge step forward.

07:38.990 --> 07:42.110
I never thought I would meet Liliel.

07:42.770 --> 07:47.110
Though it was a surprise,
I smoothly gave her the flyer, right?

07:47.750 --> 07:50.220
And she accepted it!

07:50.220 --> 07:53.930
My invitation...
Or rather, my love letter!

07:57.650 --> 07:59.530
I might have made...

07:59.950 --> 08:01.260
...my first friend!

08:01.630 --> 08:04.630
CINDERELLA STAR

08:05.540 --> 08:08.900
So this time is not
a cosplay-focused event, huh?

08:08.900 --> 08:13.430
It seems they prepared cosplay booths
for Cinderella Star's 1st anniversary.

08:14.080 --> 08:18.290
Sorry for asking you to come with us
on a Sunday, Ms. Mayuri.

08:18.290 --> 08:20.500
"We'll be attending an event next week!"
You said.

08:20.500 --> 08:22.900
It was way too sudden, you know.

08:23.520 --> 08:26.050
Being a club advisor
is definitely tough work.

08:26.050 --> 08:27.610
Is that a new camera?!

08:27.990 --> 08:30.820
Please don't buy a better camera
than we have in the club!

08:30.820 --> 08:33.080
This is the loan power of a civil servant!

08:33.470 --> 08:35.300
Liliel!

08:36.490 --> 08:38.740
She really came here!

08:38.740 --> 08:41.420
W-W-What should I do?
Greet her...

08:41.420 --> 08:42.750
I have to greet her first.

08:47.110 --> 08:49.840
Okay... Here goes...

08:50.480 --> 08:52.590
3... 2...

08:52.590 --> 08:56.270
1... 1... 1...

08:56.660 --> 08:57.180
Ah!

08:58.730 --> 09:00.410
Umm, good morning...

09:00.410 --> 09:01.100
Eh?

09:01.100 --> 09:03.060
RUMBLE RUMBLE

09:04.590 --> 09:08.740
Oh, no! She's pulling away!
She must think that I'm weirdo!

09:09.190 --> 09:11.170
I have to say something or she'll hate me...

09:11.170 --> 09:15.200
But I'm so nervous that I'm going
to say something weird...

09:15.780 --> 09:18.950
Umm, Nonoa... I'm...

09:18.950 --> 09:21.270
If I mess up and get hated,

09:21.270 --> 09:23.670
isn't it better to not say anything?

09:24.720 --> 09:25.630
Ah...!

09:26.030 --> 09:27.840
Wait, why are you running, dumbass?!

09:27.840 --> 09:30.840
I did something weird again! Idiot!

09:31.450 --> 09:33.990
I guess she doesn't like me after all.

09:38.160 --> 09:39.530
If it isn't Liliel!

09:39.530 --> 09:43.470
Even though she's a newbie like me,
she's already made a friend?

09:43.470 --> 09:44.860
She's amazing...

09:45.510 --> 09:48.670
Nagomi! Who are you cosplaying?

09:48.670 --> 09:49.690
Just my casual clothes.

09:50.060 --> 09:52.090
Ah, Nagomi. Hello there.

09:52.090 --> 09:54.970
Eek! P-P-Prince Kai?!

09:54.970 --> 09:56.190
It's Okumura.

09:56.190 --> 09:58.580
You really have a bad sense
in casual clothing as usual.

09:58.580 --> 09:59.330
Say what?

09:59.330 --> 10:00.470
Isn't this cute?!

10:00.470 --> 10:03.370
- Wait, Mayura?! Why are you here?!
- Nagomi and Miss Mayura?!

10:03.750 --> 10:07.040
Even someone like me knew
they're the Four Heavenly Queens...

10:07.570 --> 10:10.580
So you guys know each other?

10:10.580 --> 10:12.130
Yes! Because teach—

10:12.470 --> 10:16.580
I tried my best to hide it from the school,
so you can't carelessly say that in public!

10:16.580 --> 10:17.600
I-I'm sorry...

10:18.090 --> 10:19.260
Teacher?

10:20.820 --> 10:23.420
That's right, she's my disciple.

10:23.420 --> 10:24.440
Disciple?

10:24.820 --> 10:28.950
Well, it makes sense since Liliel
reminded me of Mayura when I first saw her.

10:28.950 --> 10:29.820
That means...

10:30.480 --> 10:32.500
You've approved Liliel,

10:32.500 --> 10:34.320
and she's your successor!

10:34.320 --> 10:37.780
Thanks to that blabbermouth girl,
we got this misunderstanding.

10:38.210 --> 10:40.930
Are you going to cosplay today, Nagomi?

10:40.930 --> 10:42.550
I'm looking forward to it!

10:42.550 --> 10:45.100
Of course! I'm the official guest.

10:45.100 --> 10:48.210
I'm scheduled to be
at almost all the events in the city.

10:48.210 --> 10:49.380
Almost all?!

10:49.740 --> 10:52.240
You must think that I'm annoying, right?!

10:52.240 --> 10:54.390
That's fine! I won't talk to you!

10:54.780 --> 10:55.630
So...

10:56.850 --> 11:01.390
Does that mean I can meet you
in any event I go, Nagomi?

11:01.390 --> 11:02.390
I'm so happy.

11:03.090 --> 11:06.590
Are you cute on the inside too?!
Goddamit!

11:07.660 --> 11:09.650
I see her more often though!

11:09.650 --> 11:11.110
What are you bragging about?!

11:11.110 --> 11:11.650
DRIP DRIP

11:11.650 --> 11:13.190
DRIP DRIP
I don't stand a chance...

11:13.190 --> 11:15.570
DRIP DRIP
She has more friends...

11:15.570 --> 11:16.910
DRIP DRIP
We don't match...

11:16.910 --> 11:20.580
DRIP DRIP
There's no way she'd befriend someone like me...

11:21.300 --> 11:24.580
But still, quite a lot of people came here.

11:24.580 --> 11:26.480
Huh? Yes...

11:26.480 --> 11:28.410
Prince Kai talked to me!

11:29.370 --> 11:32.250
Although this isn't a cosplay event

11:32.250 --> 11:32.790
COSPLAY PARTICIPATION REGISTRATION
Although this isn't a cosplay event

11:32.790 --> 11:35.590
COSPLAY PARTICIPATION REGISTRATION
there's a lot of photographers and cosplayers.

11:36.260 --> 11:38.020
That's because I'm the guest, you know?

11:38.020 --> 11:39.410
I think so too!

11:39.410 --> 11:41.220
It was a joke!

11:41.730 --> 11:45.140
Aren't there a lot of people
aiming for her today?

11:45.140 --> 11:47.190
Ah, they're Coulia's fans.

11:47.940 --> 11:51.420
The 5 Rising Stars have become
quite a topic lately.

11:51.420 --> 11:53.600
Although it's still just you two.

11:54.560 --> 11:56.340
They're talking about me...

11:56.340 --> 12:00.210
Could it be she invited you here?
Do you know each other?

12:00.210 --> 12:01.970
Umm, about that...

12:02.590 --> 12:05.130
I accepted a letter of challenge.

12:05.130 --> 12:07.160
L-Letter of challenge?!

12:07.810 --> 12:10.470
Someone picked a fight with you again?

12:10.470 --> 12:12.670
Umm, not that I'm one to talk...

12:12.670 --> 12:15.130
So, you were picking a fight last time, huh?

12:15.670 --> 12:20.380
That's because some cosplayers have
a strong sense of rivalry against others.

12:20.380 --> 12:21.910
Like you.

12:21.910 --> 12:25.090
But that also might be friendly rivalry

12:25.090 --> 12:27.590
or another form of enjoyment.

12:27.590 --> 12:29.940
I won't deny that.

12:29.940 --> 12:31.440
You also did that as well.

12:31.440 --> 12:33.010
What's with that look?!

12:33.010 --> 12:34.900
I'm just putting myself

12:34.900 --> 12:35.710
- in the shoes of a newbie!

12:35.710 --> 12:37.780
- She's so cute.
- in the shoes of a newbie!

12:37.780 --> 12:38.960
- But I didn't say anything.

12:38.960 --> 12:40.110
- I just wish we could be friends.
- But I didn't say anything.

12:40.110 --> 12:42.320
- I just wish we could be friends.

12:42.320 --> 12:44.720
T-T-This is bad!

12:44.720 --> 12:46.470
She's got completely the wrong idea!

12:46.470 --> 12:48.970
I've made the worst first impression...

12:48.970 --> 12:51.540
I can't make friends like this...

12:52.310 --> 12:54.380
S-Should I give up?

12:54.930 --> 12:55.980
But...

12:56.460 --> 12:58.420
You're amazing, Noa!

12:59.360 --> 13:00.900
It's Liliel!

13:00.900 --> 13:01.840
So good!

13:01.840 --> 13:03.600
- Draw me one, please!
- Back then, when I did things I liked,

13:03.600 --> 13:04.970
- Sure.
- friends would gather around me.

13:04.970 --> 13:05.910
- friends would gather around me.

13:06.270 --> 13:06.970
CARD OTAKU

13:06.970 --> 13:09.060
SHOJO MANGA OTAKU
I wasn't weird.

13:09.060 --> 13:09.610
BASEBALL OTAKU

13:09.610 --> 13:11.230
GAME OTAKU
All kids were otakus, right?

13:11.230 --> 13:12.150
All kids were otakus, right?

13:13.070 --> 13:17.060
But everyone eventually
realizes what's "normal."

13:17.060 --> 13:18.460
- It was only me who didn't realize it.

13:18.460 --> 13:20.790
- All Noa can do is draw.
- It was only me who didn't realize it.

13:20.790 --> 13:22.820
Even though we have exams.

13:22.820 --> 13:24.620
You're quitting baseball?

13:24.620 --> 13:27.410
Everyone else graduated successfully,

13:27.790 --> 13:29.910
and I still stay as an otaku.

13:30.660 --> 13:33.880
I'm all alone...

13:33.880 --> 13:36.250
Noa, what about your studies?!

13:36.250 --> 13:38.450
Are you still playing with that thing?!

13:38.450 --> 13:41.130
You're no longer a kid!
Throw it away!

13:41.710 --> 13:42.850
I am...

13:43.370 --> 13:44.780
...a weird person.

13:47.490 --> 13:48.400
But...

13:50.410 --> 13:52.480
What should we do
for the next event?

13:52.480 --> 13:53.940
I want us to cosplay Love Dolls!

13:53.940 --> 13:56.130
Then I'll cosplay as Safie.

13:56.130 --> 13:58.330
Did I still have my paycheck?

13:59.280 --> 14:05.910
How nice... Having friends as an adult
that enjoy the same hobbies.

14:07.170 --> 14:08.370
I guess...

14:08.690 --> 14:10.140
I can't give up just yet!

14:11.910 --> 14:15.360
COSPLAY WIG PLATINUM SILVER
I want to always love the things that I love,

14:15.360 --> 14:17.380
COSPLAY WIG PLATINUM SILVER
I want to think that it's fine to love it!

14:17.900 --> 14:21.220
I told myself,
"That's right, I want a friend!"

14:23.190 --> 14:25.180
I'll try once more.

14:25.840 --> 14:28.100
If I give it my all,

14:28.100 --> 14:29.950
I might be able to make a friend.

14:33.630 --> 14:35.770
I cosplayed for the first time.

14:35.770 --> 14:39.860
The me reflected in the mirror
didn't feel like me.

14:39.860 --> 14:41.700
I felt that I wasn't weird.

14:43.310 --> 14:45.450
I felt like I could do anything.

14:46.240 --> 14:48.540
I might be able to make a friend.

14:50.490 --> 14:52.550
My first event was a disaster...

14:52.550 --> 14:55.360
I guess I can't do it after all...

14:55.870 --> 14:56.620
UP AND COMING! CONCEPT

14:56.620 --> 14:58.710
I PUT HER IN 5TH PLACE THIS TIME
Liliel? In the present day?

15:04.090 --> 15:08.550
This girl must've fought hard
for what she loves.

15:09.620 --> 15:11.290
So cool...

15:11.290 --> 15:16.020
If I get to talk to her,
how happy would I feel?

15:19.020 --> 15:22.280
I wonder what'll happen
if I become friends with her...

15:23.270 --> 15:25.490
I... I can't give up!

15:27.170 --> 15:30.450
Today is the day!
I will change today!

15:31.600 --> 15:34.870
I will make my first friend ever!

15:38.770 --> 15:41.980
Thank you for waiting,
to all fellow fans of Cinderella Star!

15:41.980 --> 15:44.610
Here's our special guest, Nagomi!

15:44.610 --> 15:49.120
She'll be heading to the photoshoot
area soon, so please be patient!

15:50.140 --> 15:51.830
Wait for me, okay?

15:51.830 --> 15:53.520
I'll blow them all away.

15:54.720 --> 15:57.840
Liliel... It's not a contest today.

15:57.840 --> 16:03.230
It's not a contest to see
who will stand out the most.

16:03.230 --> 16:04.020
RUMBLE RUMBLE

16:04.020 --> 16:05.990
RUMBLE RUMBLE
But I'd still be happy to win!

16:06.430 --> 16:10.540
Wow, that was quite the impact from Nagomi.

16:10.540 --> 16:12.670
On top of casting away her doubts,

16:12.670 --> 16:15.980
she's using the style of "I'm the cutest."

16:16.570 --> 16:18.990
Nagomi right now might be
the strongest we've ever seen.

16:19.740 --> 16:21.790
Will Lilysa be alright?

16:21.790 --> 16:24.460
CHANGING ROOM
She's taking quite a while to change clothes,

16:24.460 --> 16:25.920
CHANGING ROOM
which makes us nervous.

16:26.250 --> 16:27.450
Should we check on her?

16:28.750 --> 16:30.260
This place is packed.

16:30.260 --> 16:31.600
It's all idols.

16:31.950 --> 16:33.560
I must clear up this misunderstanding.

16:33.950 --> 16:36.520
Oh, that spot looks empty.

16:36.520 --> 16:37.640
GLARE

16:37.980 --> 16:41.600
Y-You can have it!
I'll take the corner over there!

16:41.600 --> 16:42.730
Eh? No...!

16:45.880 --> 16:49.390
I failed again...
This is the third time...

16:49.930 --> 16:51.450
It can't be helped.

16:51.450 --> 16:53.690
Let's talk to her after I change.

16:53.690 --> 16:56.950
If I cosplay, I can change the atmosphere...

16:57.540 --> 16:58.460
Wait...

16:59.020 --> 17:00.820
What is Liliel going to wear?

17:00.820 --> 17:05.170
Although I invited her,
I didn't think about her costume!

17:05.540 --> 17:07.110
You dummy!

17:07.110 --> 17:10.400
The coolest part of Liliel
is when she cosplays!

17:10.400 --> 17:13.350
What do I do if I destroy that?!

17:13.850 --> 17:17.840
Did she prepare a Cinderella Star
character in a week?

17:17.840 --> 17:19.500
It's all my fault...

17:20.020 --> 17:21.310
Ugh, that was bad...

17:21.310 --> 17:23.020
My heart hurts...

17:25.900 --> 17:29.670
By the way, what character
is Amano's costume?

17:29.670 --> 17:31.210
I don't know Cinderella Star at all.

17:31.210 --> 17:33.950
Huh? Why do you know
about Lilysa's costume?

17:34.570 --> 17:35.900
We finished it together

17:35.900 --> 17:37.680
- Ms. Mayuri...
- since she came to me crying yesterday.

17:37.680 --> 17:38.380
Leave it to me.

17:38.380 --> 17:40.550
So that's how she finished it in a week!

17:40.550 --> 17:42.000
You spoil your student too much.

17:42.780 --> 17:45.520
But the costume came out perfectly.

17:45.520 --> 17:48.460
Getting help from a Heavenly Queen
has got to be cheating!

17:48.460 --> 17:52.790
But isn't it her first time cosplaying
anything other than Liliel?

17:52.790 --> 17:55.550
You think it'll be all right?

17:55.550 --> 17:57.650
Yeah. No need to worry about—

17:57.650 --> 17:58.930
Thank you for waiting.

18:01.490 --> 18:03.900
W-What do you think?

18:03.900 --> 18:05.610
She's goddam cute!

18:06.030 --> 18:07.990
Wait, isn't that Liliel?!

18:08.810 --> 18:10.070
That's right.

18:10.070 --> 18:11.420
ANGEL OF THE STAGE LILIEL

18:11.420 --> 18:12.820
ANGEL OF THE STAGE LILIEL
Cinderella Star has a gacha collab

18:12.820 --> 18:14.310
ANGEL OF THE STAGE LILIEL
with Shonen Jump!

18:14.310 --> 18:16.780
ANGEL OF THE STAGE LILIEL
Is there anything your angel can't do?!

18:17.330 --> 18:20.140
It's another story of Liliel,
who is reincarnated in the present day

18:20.140 --> 18:23.860
and aims to become an idol in order to tell
all mankind that the human world is in danger

18:23.860 --> 18:27.790
and to convey to them that all can
be saved if they all join hands!

18:27.790 --> 18:31.340
Wonderful! You understood the spin-off
material perfectly as well!

18:32.160 --> 18:35.130
In order to efficiently play
without spending money,

18:35.130 --> 18:38.070
I even spared some time
during class to clear it!

18:38.070 --> 18:40.660
I can't tell if you're very serious or not.

18:40.660 --> 18:41.930
Go study.

18:42.340 --> 18:45.650
But the skirt is shorter than usual, right?

18:45.650 --> 18:46.800
Is that alright?

18:46.800 --> 18:48.660
Ah, I'm wearing it properly.

18:48.660 --> 18:49.650
Don't show it!

18:50.590 --> 18:53.250
Liliel is really cute!

18:53.250 --> 18:55.860
She stuck with Liliel even though
it's Cinderella Star event.

18:56.970 --> 18:59.950
Ah, please... Please let it be like this!

18:59.950 --> 19:03.390
The two of us lined up...
And doing a photoshoot together...

19:04.580 --> 19:09.590
Then we'll talk about doing a matching
cosplay for this series next time.

19:09.590 --> 19:13.380
But I have to match with Liliel!
Be it an angel or a demon!

19:13.810 --> 19:17.340
I'm sure I can work something out
when I get to the venue...

19:17.340 --> 19:19.470
Oh! It's Liliel!

19:19.840 --> 19:21.520
Coulia also came!

19:21.520 --> 19:22.970
Nonoa!

19:22.970 --> 19:24.580
You read Mr. Camera's blog?

19:24.580 --> 19:25.340
Of course.

19:25.340 --> 19:28.480
The two of the Rising Stars are having
a direct confrontation this early!

19:28.480 --> 19:31.730
- Thank you!
- I didn't mean it to be a confrontation...

19:31.730 --> 19:33.900
Everyone's looking at the two of us.

19:33.900 --> 19:36.370
It's not unnatural to try and talk to her.

19:36.370 --> 19:40.450
I have to be brave to talk to her and ask
if she would like to do a photoshoot together.

19:41.910 --> 19:43.950
Woah! What is this?!

19:43.950 --> 19:46.420
W-W-Would you...

19:46.420 --> 19:47.620
What?

19:47.620 --> 19:48.750
T-This is...

19:48.750 --> 19:50.270
It's a face off!

19:50.270 --> 19:52.460
We can see a face off in cosplay!

19:52.810 --> 19:55.950
That's not it! I would never do that!

19:55.950 --> 19:58.190
- I guess they don't get along.
- I just wanted a friendly photoshoot!

19:58.940 --> 20:00.810
N-No good...

20:00.810 --> 20:03.940
If I do any more than this,
they'll misunderstand Liliel.

20:03.940 --> 20:04.810
I have to retreat...

20:04.810 --> 20:05.430
Hey...

20:06.260 --> 20:08.230
Would you like to do a photoshoot together?

20:08.970 --> 20:13.610
Eh? Could it be that she said
to go for a photoshoot together?

20:14.500 --> 20:17.650
No way. There's no way
she would say that to me.

20:17.650 --> 20:20.410
I must've been delusional and misheard it.

20:20.850 --> 20:23.250
She ignored Liliel's invitation?!

20:23.250 --> 20:24.620
It's a fight!

20:24.620 --> 20:28.460
Are you kidding me?!
It's my once in a lifetime opportunity!

20:28.460 --> 20:31.290
Not to mention I embarrassed Liliel!

20:31.290 --> 20:32.750
G-Go back...

20:34.690 --> 20:38.380
Since it's packed,
let's find a spot and start the photoshoot.

20:38.380 --> 20:39.510
Y-Yes...

20:40.030 --> 20:42.720
Why? Why am I like this?!

20:42.720 --> 20:46.480
When I try to speak, it's like there's
something pushing against my throat.

20:47.290 --> 20:49.990
Noa is...

20:52.750 --> 20:56.330
Umm... Can I take your photo, Nonoa?

20:59.050 --> 20:59.950
Huh?

20:59.950 --> 21:03.910
I'm sorry... I'm sorry... I'm sorry...
But that's not it...

21:04.310 --> 21:07.190
I didn't want to take pictures...

21:07.190 --> 21:10.910
There's no meaning in coming here
if I can't befriend Liliel...

21:18.480 --> 21:22.390
That's right.
I could speak properly back then...

21:22.390 --> 21:23.220
ANIME CLUB

21:23.220 --> 21:24.640
ANIME CLUB
That's why I think

21:24.970 --> 21:31.120
even though Himari loves Raia,
they weren't bothered with the age problem!

21:31.120 --> 21:31.910
Or rather...

21:31.910 --> 21:35.900
You know, Noa? You really run your mouth
when you talk about the things you love.

21:36.250 --> 21:38.730
- Huh? Well, if it's about manga—

21:38.730 --> 21:39.320
- Disgusting.
- Huh? Well, if it's about manga—

21:39.900 --> 21:40.420
Huh?

21:41.210 --> 21:45.190
Because there's no context and you ignored
the flow of the conversation.

21:45.190 --> 21:47.570
Or rather, you're not even
listening to us, right?

21:47.570 --> 21:49.500
Conversations are like playing catch, right?

21:49.500 --> 21:51.060
Yeah, I know that.

21:51.060 --> 21:55.120
When people are talking, you have to think
about what you want to talk about next, right?

21:55.120 --> 21:58.050
That's not how communication works.

21:58.050 --> 22:00.810
It's better if you don't speak.

22:02.300 --> 22:04.390
That's right. I...

22:04.940 --> 22:07.280
When I talk, I'll be hated.

22:07.280 --> 22:09.380
Because if I talk, it's weird.

22:09.380 --> 22:11.480
In the end, nothing changed.

22:11.480 --> 22:14.690
Nothing changed...
Even if I cosplay...

22:14.690 --> 22:16.510
Even I tried to be brave...

22:16.510 --> 22:17.570
Umm...!

23:54.950 --> 24:01.050
TOGETHER WITH YOU
